== Moulds

- outdoor moulds are present year round in BC (unless the ground freezes) but moreso in fall with decaying leaf litter
- live in dead leaves and plants and freshly mown grass

== Misc

avoid smoking and second hand smoke = makes allergies worse irritates the airways
HEPA filters - not particularly helpful. limited/uncertain benefit for allergic rhinitis - not a slam dunk and by itself very unliekly to provide significant benefit
